1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:07,360
Many people know exactly what they need. The English-only form is what stops them.

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,347
Hello. I'm a farmer, my name is Ramesh Kumar. From the Bengaluru side, village Harohalli.

3
00:00:12,347 --> 00:00:17,093
I have two acres of land, in my own name. I have a bank account too.

4
00:00:17,093 --> 00:00:21,840
Please help me fill the PM-KISAN demo form.

5
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:32,060
From the official PM-KISAN website: the scheme gives income support of 6,000 rupees per year

6
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:37,860
Bengaluru has more than one district: Bengaluru Urban, Bengaluru Rural. Which one?

7
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,760
Bengaluru Rural.

8
00:00:46,412 --> 00:00:48,194
Which mobile number should the demo portal send the verification code to? You can type it.

9
00:00:48,194 --> 00:00:51,194
Mobile typed (synthetic) · summary read back · user confirms by voice

10
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:54,961
Opening the demo portal now. You can watch every step in Mission Control.

11
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:09,039
Everything is filled. Final step: submit the demo application. This creates a demo record.

12
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:12,479
Do you approve?

13
00:01:14,579 --> 00:01:19,219
Done. The demo portal stored your application. Demo reference: GS-SC-57A608.

14
00:01:19,219 --> 00:01:23,859
This is a demo record, not an official application.

15
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:30,959
GramSetu. Built with Gnani Prisma and Timbre.

